"Adds the Hijri date beside the Gregorian one on letters. The research found "
"no rule requiring dual dating on Iraqi correspondence - the Registrar's own "
"bulletin and the Iraqi Official Gazette use Gregorian alone - so this is off"
" by default."
msgstr "الوقائع العراقية"

#. module: legal_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_core.view_legal_signatory_form
msgid ""
"An Iraqi official letter is constituted by the letterhead, the signature\n"
"                        and the seal printed together. A letter without the seal is a draft, and\n"
"                        the counter will say so."
msgstr ""
"الكتاب الرسمي العراقي يتكون من الترويسة والتوقيع\n"
"والختم مطبوعة معًا. والكتاب بلا ختم مسودة،\n"
"والشباك سيقول ذلك."

